coverage/
server/coverage/
playwright-report/
*.part

# Local only, never published (kept on the installation that develops Anzo, and in its full archive: LOCAL_DOCS in
# scripts/ops/archive-lib.js). Public docs describe the current state only; development history goes to docs/review/.
# the installation's own notes
docs/README-private.md
# notes for development sessions on that server
CLAUDE.md
docs/gotchas.md
server/test/local-*.test.js
# its publishing notes
docs/publishing.md
# the development history and the working papers (reviews, reviewer briefs, the per-unit status)
docs/review/
content/review/
content/STATUS.md
